      "description": "A monster that has grown brutal due to the effects of its environment. Its well-developed teeth and claws are sharper and harder than many an ill-forged blade. It leaps up into the air using its powerful hind legs and uses these teeth to rip the throats from its victims. Many the adventurer has lost his this way. These creatures are so unnaturally violent that some wonder if the devil himself did not purposefully chose the most harmless looking animal imaginable and possess it to create this abomination."
